First, we followed the overall time of the vignettes, which includes animation, text description, video clip, and photos. We also asked for the length of each individual vignette. Second, we measured the complexity of the text, which includes sentence length and information type (e.g., descriptive, reflective, and evaluative). We examined each vignette individually, and calculated the length of all the text in each, and the average number of words for each vignette. Finally, we asked for the proportion of evaluative content.

